  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧物聯網實務應用",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL APPLICATION OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE AND INTERNET OF THINGS",
    "describe_ch": "智慧物聯網是基於物聯網來收集所有連網的感知器數據後再回傳至運算端，並交由神經網路模型的運算與分析以讓數據變的更加有價值並結合應用。因此，智慧物聯網是一門適合訓練學生在系統整合與應用的課程，此課程將先介紹物聯網架構及應用，再介紹如何選用合適的神經網路模型與物聯網結合並應用。為了讓學生可以深刻的學習，在每個課程單元後都有實作課程，透過此課程的學習學生可以更加熟悉物聯網環境的建置以及如何將人工智慧技術整合至物聯網與應用。",
    "describe_eh": "The Artificial Intelligence of Things (AIoT) is based on the Internet of Things (IoT) to collect sensing data from IoT devices. The collected data can then be applied to the neural network model to determine more valuable information and use it in some applications. Therefore, the AIoT course is suitable for students to learn integration and application. This course introduces the structure and applications of the IoT. The course will then introduce how to integrate a suitable neural network model into the IoT to form an AIoT application. For efficient learning, after each course unit, the students are asked to do a practical lab. This course can help the student get familiar with the IoT environment construction and the integration and application of AI technology and IoT.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
